IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sga3-78a-78c`

-- Tests for sga3-78a-78c.l4 (ss 78A, 78B, 78C; lines 9300-9500 of inputs/CoA1967.txt). Every expected value is decided from the text before the run.

-- A solvency statement the keel's s 7A(1) accepts for a reduction of share capital: made by the directors, with every opinion s 7A(1) asks for, not meant to precede winding up, three directors.
GIVEN `the date of the statement` IS A DATE
      `the proposal it concerns` IS A `Proposal needing a solvency statement`
      `the number of directors who signed it` IS A NUMBER
      `the auditor's report accompanies it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Solvency statement`
`s 78B(3) test statement` MEANS `Solvency statement` OF `the proposal it concerns`, `the date of the statement`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3, `the number of directors who signed it`, `the auditor's report accompanies it`

-- ===== s 78A =====
-- (5), (5A), (6): "This Division does not apply to an unlimited company", to the redemption of preference shares under s 70(1), or to the purchase under ss 76B to 76G.
#ASSERT `s 78A(5) this Division does not apply to the company or the reduction` `unlimited` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(5) this Division does not apply to the company or the reduction` `limited by shares` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(5) this Division does not apply to the company or the reduction` `limited by shares` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(5) this Division does not apply to the company or the reduction` `limited by shares` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78A(5) this Division does not apply to the company or the reduction` `limited by guarantee` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1) "A company may reduce its share capital under the provisions of this Division in any way": a grant; where the Division does not apply, or the constitution excludes the power, not covered.
#ASSERT `s 78A(1) the company may reduce its share capital under the provisions of this Division` `limited by shares` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(1) the company may reduce its share capital under the provisions of this Division` `limited by guarantee` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(1) the company may reduce its share capital under the provisions of this Division` `unlimited` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78A(1) the company may reduce its share capital under the provisions of this Division` `limited by shares` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78A(1) the company may reduce its share capital under the provisions of this Division` `limited by shares` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78A(1) the company may reduce its share capital under the provisions of this Division` `limited by shares` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) "A company may not reduce its share capital in any way except by a procedure provided for it by the provisions of this Division": a bar.
#ASSERT `s 78A(2) the reduction of share capital is barred` `limited by shares` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(2) the reduction of share capital is barred` `limited by shares` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- An unlimited company is not precluded ("does not preclude such a company from reducing in any way its share capital"); the other two exclusions leave the bar not covered.
#ASSERT `s 78A(2) the reduction of share capital is barred` `unlimited` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78A(2) the reduction of share capital is barred` `limited by shares` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78A(2) the reduction of share capital is barred` `limited by shares` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3) the constitution may exclude or restrict the power.
#ASSERT `s 78A(3) the constitution may exclude or restrict the power` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(3) the constitution may exclude or restrict the power` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) "reduction information" means the amount of the share capital reduced and the number of shares cancelled, in relation to a special resolution.
#ASSERT `s 78A(4) "reduction information" the information is reduction information` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78A(4) "reduction information" the information is reduction information` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78A(4) "reduction information" the information is reduction information` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78A(4) "reduction information" the information is reduction information` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) "resolution date" means the date when the resolution is passed.
#ASSERT `s 78A(4) "resolution date" the resolution date` (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS Date 1 6 2026

-- ===== s 78B =====
-- (2) the company need not meet the solvency requirements if the reduction involves neither a reduction or distribution of cash or assets nor a release of a liability.
#ASSERT `s 78B(2) the company need not meet the solvency requirements` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(2) the company need not meet the solvency requirements` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(2) the company need not meet the solvency requirements` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(2) the company need not meet the solvency requirements` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1) a private company limited by shares may reduce by special resolution if it meets the solvency requirements (or need not) and the publicity requirements.
-- Inputs in order: private company; liability; special resolution; involves cash or assets; involves release; meets the solvency requirements; meets the publicity requirements.
#ASSERT `s 78B(1) the private company limited by shares may reduce its share capital in any way by a special resolution` TRUE `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(1) the private company limited by shares may reduce its share capital in any way by a special resolution` TRUE `limited by shares` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(1) the private company limited by shares may reduce its share capital in any way by a special resolution` TRUE `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(1) the private company limited by shares may reduce its share capital in any way by a special resolution` TRUE `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(1) the private company limited by shares may reduce its share capital in any way by a special resolution` TRUE `limited by shares` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(1) the private company limited by shares may reduce its share capital in any way by a special resolution` FALSE `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(1) the private company limited by shares may reduce its share capital in any way by a special resolution` TRUE `limited by guarantee` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3) the solvency requirements: every director makes a solvency statement, made in time for (4)(a) and not before the beginning of the 20 days ending with the resolution date.
-- Resolution date 1 June 2026: the 20 days ending with it begin on 13 May 2026. The statement must be made on or before the day (4)(a) falls due (here 1 June 2026).
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 13 5 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 3 FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 12 5 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 3 FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 1 6 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 3 FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 2 6 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 3 FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not every director made it.
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 13 5 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 3 FALSE) TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not a solvency statement under s 7A: an exempt company needs every director's signature; another company may instead attach the auditor's report.
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 13 5 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 2 FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 13 5 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 2 TRUE) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 13 5 2026) `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C` 2 FALSE) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A statement made for another proposal, or for no named proposal, is not "a solvency statement in relation to the reduction of capital".
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 13 5 2026) `a giving of financial assistance under section 76(9A) or (9B)` 3 FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`s 78B(3) test statement` (Date 13 5 2026) `some other proposal` 3 FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (4)(a) the lead-in "Unless subsection (2) applies": a contravention is not possible where (2) applies.
-- Inputs in order: how the resolution is passed; involves cash or assets; involves release; copies served with the statement; statement available at the meeting.
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(a) the company has contravened paragraph (a)` `s 78B(4)(a)(i) by written means under section 184A` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(a) the company has contravened paragraph (a)` `s 78B(4)(a)(i) by written means under section 184A` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(a) the company has contravened paragraph (a)` `s 78B(4)(a)(ii) in a general meeting` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(a) the company has contravened paragraph (a)` `s 78B(4)(a)(ii) in a general meeting` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(a) the company has contravened paragraph (a)` `s 78B(4)(a) in some other way` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(a) the company has contravened paragraph (a)` `s 78B(4)(a)(i) by written means under section 184A` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (6) the 6 weeks beginning with 1 June 2026 end on 12 July 2026; if the resolution is revoked the requirement ceases (read as the day before the revocation).
#ASSERT `s 78B(6) the last day to which the requirement under subsection (4)(b) runs` (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) EQUALS Date 12 7 2026
#ASSERT `s 78B(6) the last day to which the requirement under subsection (4)(b) runs` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE (Date 20 6 2026) EQUALS Date 19 6 2026
#ASSERT `s 78B(6) the last day to which the requirement under subsection (4)(b) runs` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE (Date 12 7 2026) EQUALS Date 11 7 2026
#ASSERT `s 78B(6) the last day to which the requirement under subsection (4)(b) runs` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE (Date 13 7 2026) EQUALS Date 12 7 2026
-- (4)(b) available "throughout the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date": from 1 June to 12 July 2026 inclusive.
-- Inputs in order: involves cash or assets; involves release; resolution date; revoked; date revoked; was made available; first day available; last day available.
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 12 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE (Date 2 6 2026) (Date 12 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 11 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 13 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 12 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` FALSE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 12 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Revoked on 20 June: the requirement runs to 19 June.
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE (Date 20 6 2026) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 19 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(4)(b) the company has contravened paragraph (b)` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE (Date 20 6 2026) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 18 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (5) the resolution does not become invalid by virtue only of a contravention of (4); every officer in default is guilty of an offence.
#ASSERT `s 78B(5) the resolution is invalid by virtue only of a contravention of subsection (4)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(5) the resolution is invalid by virtue only of a contravention of subsection (4)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78B(5) the officer is guilty of an offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 78B(5) the officer is guilty of an offence` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(5) the officer is guilty of an offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78B(5) the officer is guilty of an offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The duties. (4)(a): no day is named, so only FULFILLED or RESIDUAL can be shown.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(a) the company must make the solvency statement available as the paragraph requires` "Acme Pte Ltd" `s 78B(4)(a)(ii) in a general meeting` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(a)(ii) make the solvency statement or a copy of it available for inspection by the members throughout the general meeting` AT 2
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(a) the company must make the solvency statement available as the paragraph requires` "Acme Pte Ltd" `s 78B(4)(a)(i) by written means under section 184A` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 60)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(a) the company must make the solvency statement available as the paragraph requires` "Acme Pte Ltd" `s 78B(4)(a) in some other way` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 60)
-- (4)(b): day 0 is the resolution date; the statement is there on day 0 and is not withdrawn up to day 41.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) the company must make the solvency statement available throughout the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) make the solvency statement or a copy of it available at the registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 0
    (WAITUNTIL 42)
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) the company must make the solvency statement available throughout the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) make the solvency statement or a copy of it available at the registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) withdraw the solvency statement or a copy of it from inspection by creditors before the end of the 6 weeks` AT 20
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) the company must make the solvency statement available throughout the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) make the solvency statement or a copy of it available at the registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 3
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) the company must make the solvency statement available throughout the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 1)

-- ===== s 78C =====
